  "bio": "Derek Billingsley, a traditional-style tattoo artist based in Fullerton, United States, boasts of a robust Instagram following of around 62,000 people. Known for his unique black palm designs, his commendable skill level in the art has made him a standout and much-admired artist in the tattoo industry. Working out of the well-known Black Palm studio in Orange, CA, Derek is on a constant grind, committed to delivering nothing short of perfection in every piece.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Fullerton, California, United States"
